-- src:41534 | (a) the person making the offer is liable to repay those moneys
-- src:41535 | with interest at the rate of 10% per annum from the
-- src:41536 | expiration of such 14 days; and
@ref s 259(2)(a) (src:41526-41536)
GIVEN
    `what section 259(1) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 259(1) the permission was not applied for or not granted in time` answer for the prospectus? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `what section 259(3) answers` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN @desc What does the function `s 259(3) the Authority may exempt the allotment` answer for the allotment? (JUST TRUE, JUST FALSE, or NOTHING if you do not know.)
    `the date the person making the offer became liable to repay` IS A DATE @desc On what date did the person making the offer become liable to repay the moneys?
    `the moneys have been repaid` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Have all the moneys been repaid?
