-- FORK F62 (see NOTES.md, Fork register)
`s 259(2)(a) the person making the offer is liable to repay with interest at 10% per annum` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF (`what section 259(1) answers` EQUALS JUST FALSE) OR (`what section 259(3) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Where the permission has not been applied for, or has not been granted as mentioned under subsection (1)"
        IF `the moneys have been repaid` AND (`the date the moneys were repaid` AT MOST (`period: the last day of a period after` `the date the person making the offer became liable to repay` 14 Days))
        THEN JUST FALSE  -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if any such moneys is not repaid within 14 days after the person making the offer so becomes liable to repay them"  -- MARGINAL-READING (a)
        IF (`what section 259(1) answers` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the answer under subsection (1) was not worked out

