-- src:41782 | consequence of such contravention.
@ref s 260(7B) (src:41770-41782)
GIVEN
    `the trustee-manager of a business trust contravenes a provision of this section` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Does the trustee-manager of a business trust contravene any of the provisions of section 260?
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
