    IF `the trustee-manager of a business trust contravenes a provision of this section` AND `the business trust has sustained loss, damages or costs as a consequence of the contravention`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "to pay into the trust property of the business trust any loss, damages or costs which the business trust"

